%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f96e7e3d7333da94dbd2291bd9279fef, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialLine1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc6b683419b46daba35c5468be3e9e, type: 3}
    side: 0
    dialogueText: Hi! It's me, the spirit of Lady Liberty. I see you've started a
      revolution, but you'll need more than just passion to defeat those dastardly
      counts!
    seen: 0
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc6b683419b46daba35c5468be3e9e, type: 3}
    side: 1
    dialogueText: At the top of the screen, you should be able to see the resources
      you'll need to keep this revolution ball rollilng, as well as your current
      army.
    seen: 0
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc6b683419b46daba35c5468be3e9e, type: 3}
    side: 1
    dialogueText: Each turn, your fellow revolutionaries who live in each of the
      towns you've liberated will help you produce resources. Of course, you can
      also help them produce more by building infrastructure in their towns.
    seen: 0
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc6b683419b46daba35c5468be3e9e, type: 3}
    side: 1
    dialogueText: However, buildings and armies are expensive, so they'll also consume
      some resources to maintain. <sprite="final_icons" index=5> Food feeds your
      army, <sprite="final_icons" index=4> Gold pays for buildings and units alike,
      and <sprite="final_icons" index=6> Lumber is used to build new buildings.
    seen: 0
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc6b683419b46daba35c5468be3e9e, type: 3}
    side: 0
    dialogueText: You'll have to liberate new counties in order to keep sustaining
      your growing army. Take the fight to the counts and bring them down!
    seen: 0
